  id: heptabutton
  title: The Heptabutton
  author: Infusion
  description: "It could have been the Octabutton, but that\u2019s called a [b]S[/b]uper
    [b]T[/b]hin [b]O[/b]ctagonal [b]P[/b]rism.\n\nPress, hold, and release this heptagonal
    button at a certain time across seven stages.\n\nThere's the Triangle Button,
    Square Button, the Pentabutton, the Hexabutton, and now the Heptabutton. It's
    also my second module.\n\nManual can be found at ktane.timwi.de or in the bundled
    manuals folder.\nSource code is at https://github.com/Infusion478/KTANE-The-Heptabutton\n\nComes
    with Twitch Plays and colorblind support."
  version: 1.1
  outputFolder: build
  previewImage: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9f6025523e9d29149a35a4454db5a131, type: 3}
